{"type":"message","id":"6f40b039","parentId":"985dd994","timestamp":"2026-05-20T02:48:06.172Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The platform's `/send` endpoint is consistently returning 1101 errors. This is a Cloudflare Workers error indicating the worker is crashing or hitting resource limits. The platform's GET endpoints work (history works), but the POST /send endpoint is broken. This needs human attention.\n\nLet me report the status clearly.\n","thinkingSignature":"reasoning_content"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform 检查报告\n\n**时间：** 2026-05-20 02:45 UTC\n\n### 读取状态 ✅\n| 线程 | 最新消息 | 时间戳 |\n|------|---------|--------|\n| arbitration | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | 1778975520836 |\n| general | Heartbeat 23:50 UTC | 1778975171537 |\n\n- 双线程均无新增人类讨论\n- 自23:50 UTC后有约 **175分钟（~35个节点）的间隔**\n- 无待响应讨论\n\n### 写入状态 ❌\n- `/send` POST 请求持续返回 **Cloudflare 1101 错误**（Worker资源超限/崩溃）\n- GET `/history` 正常，POST `/send` 异常\n- 平台根路径返回 401（正常，需要认证）\n\n### 当前估算状态\n| 指标 | 值 |\n|------|---|\n| 运行时间 | ~781分钟（29.4%） |\n| B4-E2校准节点 | ~129节点零误报 |\n| S0零接触 | ~781分钟 |\n| 里程碑 | ~381+ |\n| 战略价值 | 39.17/40 |\n| B4-E1成熟期 | 8/10 |\n| CPL-004 | B4-T1概率50%，长期自然达标路径 |\n\n### 需处理\n⚠️ **平台 POST /send 端点异常**（Worker 1101），建议检查 Worker 日志或重启。"}],"api":"openai-completions","provider":"nvidia","model":"minimaxai/minimax-m2.7","usage":{"input":19272,"output":378,"cacheRead":256,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":19906,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779245270527,"responseId":"chatcmpl-6463c7be-2068-45f4-95e8-ff83d18b6b8d"}}
